#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":samp:`https://d-portal.iatistandard.org/ctrack.html?&reporting_ref={org-"
"id}#view=main`"
msgstr ""
":samp:`https://d-portal.iatistandard.org/ctrack.html?&reporting_ref={org-"
"id}#view=main`"

# REVIEWED: ee129f771a411137
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:76
msgid ""
"This allows you to access an organisation's data when they are not using "
"their validated organisation-identifier in their publication."
msgstr ""
"Esto le permite acceder a los datos de una organización cuando esta no está "
"utilizando su identificador de organización validado en su publicación."

# REVIEWED: 090a3ce8f2e7144f
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:78
msgid ""
"`Recipient Country <https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/country/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`País receptor <https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/country/>`_"

# REVIEWED: ed80276156dea28f
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:79
msgid ""
"An ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 code specifying the recipient country of an activity "
"or transaction."
msgstr ""
"Un código ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 que especifica el país receptor de una "
"actividad o transacción."

# REVIEWED: 6082a5135fc1aae1
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:81
msgid ""
"`Related Activity Type <https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/relatedactivitytype/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Tipo de actividad relacionada <https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/relatedactivitytype/>`_"

# REVIEWED: 4a52b5dcffd93f94
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:82
msgid ""
"A code defining the relationship between an IATI activity and another, "
"separately reported IATI activity."
msgstr ""
"Código que indica la relación entre una actividad de la IATI y otra "
"actividad de la IATI notificada por separado."

# REVIEWED: 0a9ccc16d5f90c76
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:84
msgid ""
"`Result Type <https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/resulttype/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Tipo de resultado <https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/resulttype/>`_"

# REVIEWED: 0fdf80a595ddc813
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:85
msgid "A code defining the type of result being reported in an activity."
msgstr ""
"Código que define el tipo de resultado que se informa en una actividad."

# REVIEWED: dd12c618710a3365
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:87
msgid ""
"`Sector <https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-standard/203/codelists/sector/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Sector <https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-standard/203/codelists/sector/>`_"

# REVIEWED: fb7cf5e904860fb4
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:88
msgid ""
"An OECD DAC 5-digit code classifying the purpose of an activity or "
"transaction."
msgstr ""
"Código de 5 dígitos del CAD de la OCDE que clasifica la finalidad de una "
"actividad o transacción."

# REVIEWED: 73748972dcc3b0d1
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:90
msgid ""
"`Sector Group <https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/sectorcategory/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Grupo de sector <https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/sectorcategory/>`_"

# REVIEWED: 6d3b86d05e9011cb
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:91
msgid ""
"An OECD DAC 3-digit code classifying the purpose of an activity or "
"transaction."
msgstr ""
"Código de 3 dígitos del CAD de la OCDE que clasifica la finalidad de una "
"actividad o transacción."

# REVIEWED: f25abca3c417f084
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:93
msgid ""
"`Tag Vocabulary <https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/tagvocabulary/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Vocabulario de etiquetas <https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/tagvocabulary/>`_"

# REVIEWED: 59dfb1bd6b33e713
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:94
msgid ""
"A code defining the tag classification vocabulary used in an activity. For "
"example, the UN Sustainable Development Goals codelist."
msgstr ""
"Código que indica el vocabulario de clasificación de etiquetas utilizado en "
"una actividad. Por ejemplo, la lista de códigos de los Objetivos de "
"Desarrollo Sostenible de las Naciones Unidas."

# REVIEWED: fcfb4338acbafef7
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:96
msgid "Total Outgoing Commitment"
msgstr "Compromiso saliente total"

# REVIEWED: 1bfafa35024c3953
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:97
msgid ""
"The sum of all outgoing commitment `type transactions "
"<https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-standard/203/codelists/transactiontype/>`_"
" in an activity. This can be used to filter activities by minimum and/or "
"maximum total Outgoing Commitment."
msgstr ""
"La suma de todos los `tipos de transacciones "
"<https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-standard/203/codelists/transactiontype/>`_"
" que sean compromisos salientes en una actividad. Se puede utilizar para "
"filtrar las actividades por compromiso saliente total mínimo o máximo."

# REVIEWED: 254133786e831031
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:100
msgid ""
"`Transaction Type <https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/transactiontype/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Tipo de transacción <https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-"
"standard/203/codelists/transactiontype/>`_"

# REVIEWED: 37de7249a4ae6113
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:101
msgid ""
"A code defining the type of transactions in an activity, for example "
"disbursements, or incoming commitments."
msgstr ""
"Código que indica el tipo de transacciones de una actividad, por ejemplo, "
"los desembolsos o los compromisos recibidos."

# REVIEWED: 5446755818c5dbe0
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:103
msgid "Year Range"
msgstr "Rango de años"

# REVIEWED: cde8664f8e420b20
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:104
msgid ""
"The start and/or end year of an activity, taken from actual and planned "
"activity dates. The filter looks for activities that were active in the "
"period between the minimum and maximum year. So activities that started "
"before the end of the max year and ended after the start of the minimum year"
" will be returned."
msgstr ""
"El año de inicio y/o finalización de una actividad, tomado de las fechas "
"reales y previstas de la actividad. El filtro busca actividades que "
"estuvieron activas en el período comprendido entre el año mínimo y el año "
"máximo. Por lo tanto, se devolverán las actividades que comenzaron antes del"
" final del año máximo y finalizaron después del inicio del año mínimo."
